{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "先用快慢指针判断是否有环：慢指针每次走一步，快指针每次走两步，示例中二者最终在索引 3 相遇。随后把一个指针放回头节点，另一个留在相遇点，两者都改为每次走一步；它们再次相遇的位置就是入环节点，示例中为索引 1。整个过程只使用两个指针，因此额外空间复杂度为 O(1)，且不修改链表。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>环形链表 II 可视化</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  main{ max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px 10px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .intro { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  .panel { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; }\n  .panel-title { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .chain { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: stretch; gap: 6px; }\n  .node-wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }\n  .node { width: 48px; min-height: 52px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px; padding: 4px 3px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #252526; transition: .35s; text-align: center; }\n  .node.active { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; }\n  .node.entry { border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .value { font: 14px \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-weight: 600; }\n  .index { color: #8d8d8d; font: 10px \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .pointers { min-height: 16px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 2px; }\n  .pointer { padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-size: 10px; }\n  .node.active .pointer { color: #fff; }\n  .arrow { color: #3794ff; font: 12px \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .loop-row { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border-left: 3px solid #3794ff; background: #252526; font-size: 12px; }\n  .mono { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .status { padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; font-size: 12px; }\n  .phase { margin-bottom: 4px; color: #3794ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; }\n  .explain { line-height: 1.45; }\n  .progress { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .bar { flex: 1; height: 3px; border-radius: 3px; background: #3c3c3c; transition: background .3s; min-width: 20px; }\n  .bar.done { background: #3794ff; }\n  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .legend span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }\n  .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 3px; background: #0e639c; border: 1px solid #3794ff; }\n  .result { color: #d4d4d4; font-weight: 600; }\n\n.chain .node { width: 110px; min-height: 112px; }\n.chain .pointers { min-height: 36px; align-content: center; }\n.chain .pointer { white-space: nowrap; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>示例 1：寻找环的入口</h1>\n  <p class=\"intro\">输入 <span class=\"mono\">head = [3, 2, 0, -4], pos = 1</span>。尾节点的 <span class=\"mono\">next</span> 指回索引 <span class=\"mono\">1</span>。</p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">链表结构与当前指针</div>\n    <div class=\"chain\">\n      <div class=\"node-wrap\"><div class=\"node\" data-index=\"0\"><div class=\"value\">3</div><div class=\"index\">索引 0</div><div class=\"pointers\"></div></div><div class=\"arrow\">→</div></div>\n      <div class=\"node-wrap\"><div class=\"node entry\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"value\">2</div><div class=\"index\">索引 1 · 入环候选</div><div class=\"pointers\"></div></div><div class=\"arrow\">→</div></div>\n      <div class=\"node-wrap\"><div class=\"node\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"value\">0</div><div class=\"index\">索引 2</div><div class=\"pointers\"></div></div><div class=\"arrow\">→</div></div>\n      <div class=\"node-wrap\"><div class=\"node\" data-index=\"3\"><div class=\"value\">-4</div><div class=\"index\">索引 3</div><div class=\"pointers\"></div></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"loop-row\"><span class=\"mono\">索引 3.next → 索引 1</span>，因此环为 <span class=\"mono\">1 → 2 → 3 → 1</span>。</div>\n    <div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot\"></i> 当前指针所在节点</span><span>慢指针：每次 1 步</span><span>快指针：每次 2 步</span></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">推演过程</div>\n    <div class=\"status\">\n      <div class=\"phase\" id=\"phase\"></div>\n      <div class=\"explain\" id=\"explain\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const steps = [\n    { phase: '阶段一：从头节点出发', text: '慢指针和快指针都位于索引 0。若快指针或它的下一个节点为空，就说明没有环。', pointers: {0: ['慢', '快']} },\n    { phase: '阶段一：第一次移动', text: '慢指针走 1 步到索引 1；快指针走 2 步到索引 2。', pointers: {1: ['慢'], 2: ['快']} },\n    { phase: '阶段一：第二次移动', text: '慢指针到索引 2；快指针沿 2 → 3 → 1，到达索引 1。', pointers: {2: ['慢'], 1: ['快']} },\n    { phase: '阶段一：确认存在环', text: '慢指针到索引 3；快指针沿 1 → 2 → 3，也到达索引 3。二者相遇，确认链表有环。', pointers: {3: ['慢', '快']} },\n    { phase: '阶段二：重置一个指针', text: '把指针 A 放回头节点索引 0，指针 B 留在相遇点索引 3；接下来二者都每次走 1 步。', pointers: {0: ['A'], 3: ['B']} },\n    { phase: '阶段二：同步前进', text: 'A 从索引 0 走到索引 1；B 从索引 3 沿回边也走到索引 1。', pointers: {1: ['A', 'B']} },\n    { phase: '得到答案', text: '<span class=\"result\">两个指针在索引 1 再次相遇，该节点就是环的入口。</span>', pointers: {1: ['入口']} },\n    { phase: '复杂度与无环情况', text: '时间复杂度为 <span class=\"mono\">O(n)</span>，额外空间复杂度为 <span class=\"mono\">O(1)</span>。若阶段一遇到空指针，则直接返回 <span class=\"mono\">null</span>。', pointers: {} }\n  ];\n  const nodes = [...document.querySelectorAll('.node')];\n  const phase = document.getElementById('phase');\n  const explain = document.getElementById('explain');\n  const progress = document.getElementById('progress');\n  steps.forEach(() => {\n    const bar = document.createElement('div');\n    bar.className = 'bar';\n    progress.appendChild(bar);\n  });\n  const bars = [...progress.children];\n  let current = 0;\n\n  function render() {\n    const step = steps[current];\n    phase.textContent = step.phase;\n    explain.innerHTML = step.text;\n    nodes.forEach(node => {\n      const index = node.dataset.index;\n      const labels = step.pointers[index] || [];\n      node.classList.toggle('active', labels.length > 0);\n      const box = node.querySelector('.pointers');\n      box.innerHTML = '';\n      labels.forEach(label => {\n        const tag = document.createElement('span');\n        tag.className = 'pointer';\n        tag.textContent = label + ' 指针';\n        box.appendChild(tag);\n      });\n    });\n    bars.forEach((bar, i) => bar.classList.toggle('done', i <= current));\n    current = (current + 1) % steps.length;\n  }\n\n  render();\n  setInterval(render, 2200);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
